  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Добро пожаловать</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#fff\"> в мой мод \"PVP Bot\", который сейчас находится в бета-версии и&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color:#fff\">скоро будет портирован на Bedrock Edition,</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; этот мод добавляет в вашу игру PvP-ботов с разными скинами и механиками</span></p>\n<h1><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\">Обновление 0.01</span></span></h1>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Что нового?</span></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">Добавлено</span>: \"YellowBot\", \"Dream\", \"Camman18\" и \"ManhuntBot\"</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Изменено</span>: \"ProPlayerXD\" и \"1010101010101010\"</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Исправлены</span> некоторые ошибки</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Удалено</span>: \"S\"</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Все боты</span></h1>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1247639/description_8024f619-4d4e-4427-8ad0-866e352a52b7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"131\" height=\"150\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img style=\"color:#fff\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1247639/description_7add87a6-efb0-4a8d-ad97-47761d191f60.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"151\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1247639/description_5b5a264c-7585-42fd-963b-0810fc433e7d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1247639/description_4d5ef1ad-0d99-40d3-8789-8de7afafcb02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"149\" height=\"149\"></p>\n<h5>&nbsp;</h5>\n<h5>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</h5>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#fff\">NoobBot&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;|&nbsp; ProPlayerXD&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | 1010101010101010&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| PracticeBot</span></p>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Механика:</span> Новичок&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Механика:</span> Опытный&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Механика:</span> Читер&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Механика:</span> Тренировка</span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#fff\">ходит медленнее&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; бьёт быстрее&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;дальнобойный&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;имеет 10.000 HP</span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#fff\">бьёт медленнее&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; может носить броню&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; сильный отброс</span></h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1247639/description_9ebe3342-9a91-4adc-8522-7e76e9b0ecb9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"95\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1247639/description_e0a01225-e9e1-47f5-b67a-9a97fa517862.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1247639/description_52c09e69-fa77-4c27-9769-743e475b4f7c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1247639/description_ed04d33e-9de6-4e1a-81b9-fbcb2171b314.png\" alt=\"ManhuntBot\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">YellowBot&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| Camman18&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;| Dream&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; | ManhuntBot</span></p>\n<h5><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"color:#fff;text-decoration:underline\">Механика:</span></span><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Механика:</span> Паркур Про&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Механика:</span> Опытный&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Механика:</span> Охотник</span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#fff\">не двигается и не бьёт&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; может тушить&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;может тушить</span></h5>\n<h5><span style=\"color:#fff\">имеет 10.000 HP&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;может ломать/ставить блоки</span></h5>\n<p><span style=\"color:#fff\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; может есть хлеб</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:120px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:120px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:120px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:120px\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left:40px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1247639/description_92976849-3e22-4d4a-9350-916752aaffe7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"244\" height=\"244\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4d8cf468-4cca-4201-b881-7b42dbd2529c.png\" alt=\"Продвинутый бот\" width=\"210\" height=\"248\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">Важно</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Помните, что этот мод находится в стадии бета-тестирования, поэтому в нём будет много ошибок</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Если у вас есть идеи для этого мода или вы нашли ошибки, вы можете оставить комментарий</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;и, возможно, я их добавлю...</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ------------------------------------------------------------</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; вдохновлено аддоном \"PvB Addon [InfiteWorld]\" от Hi Errs</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
